<title>HONG KONG: Citybus to issue 250 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Citybus to issue 250 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citybus Group Ltd, the bus operation unit of CNT Group Ltd, said on Monday it was issuing 250 million shares at HK$1.42 per share in an initial public offering (IPO) in Hong Kong.</p>
</text>
